{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《哈利波特》（Harry Potter）系列飾演「金妮」的35歲英國女星邦妮韋特（Bonnie Wright）周六（17日）於社交網站宣布為美國商人丈夫Andrew Lococo誕下第2胎，分享BB照片，表示：「同我哋個仔Aster Sky Wright Lococo打個招呼，佢9月28日喺屋企出世，以星形花朵命名。我哋個小星星受到佢哥哥Elio寵愛。多謝宇宙帶畀我呢對充滿愛嘅囝囝！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:18:48.172774+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:51:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T15:17:59.978724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:41.654063+00:00","content_hash":"fcb5ba55c1c5ba430875581e129076be27eb767c4cb762d8bd764f99c0ccd499","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}